				xp_levels: 3
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "89DA3283FBE7FFDA"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Watch the Walls Grow"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["BE3E01220D23C31D", "7D3A5F912E6C0B48"]
			description: [
				"The stand's been waiting a long time for something to hold. Set the pendant down and the wall stops being a wall - for you, anyway. Everything out there stops watching you and starts watching it instead. No more mending, no more warmth, but nothing's stopping you from walking past that line. Just remember what you're leaving unguarded."
			]
			icon: "kubejs:amulet_pedestal"
			id: "4B8F2D6A93E7C051"
			tasks: [{
				id: "E1A6C4F97B92D30E"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Leave It Behind"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["BE3E01220D23C31D"]
			description: [
				"Five waves. That's the whole story of whoever came before - start to finish, blade to dust. You've matched them. Now you get to find out what happens after the story usually ends."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:wither_skeleton_skull"
			id: "E5587D743FF3F653"
			tasks: [{
				id: "F52E626FCE12BEB0"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "The Reckoning"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["E5587D743FF3F653"]
			description: [
				"Eight is where the map runs out. Nobody wrote down what comes after, because nobody who saw it lived to write it down. From here it's the same night, over and over, until it isn't. How long you last is the only story left to tell."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:totem_of_undying"
			id: "0AA7EE28701688CA"
